{"title":"The Summer Court","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The fae court is mustering in the east Old Wood under the Summer Queen. Captain Maren Holt means to end it where it starts.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/captain-maren-holt\">Captain Maren Holt</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"captain-maren-holt\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/summer-sigil\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/cffcac951f9272851dce.svg\" alt=\"\">Summer Sigil</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/captain-maren-holt\">Captain Maren Holt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors around 1696, 1797)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1696|1797|Captain Maren Holt\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Ask Ysolde Fairweather <span class=\"muted\">at 1732, 1796</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1732|1796|Ask Ysolde Fairweather\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">The Summer Queen <span class=\"muted\">at 2256, 1470</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"2256|1470|The Summer Queen\">Show on map</button><br>Summer sigil - <a href=\"#/item/summer-sigil\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/cffcac951f9272851dce.svg\" alt=\"\">Summer Sigil</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 1696, 1797</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1696|1797|Summer sigil\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>31,360</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>980,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Choose one</td><td><a href=\"#/item/queens-thorn-longsword\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/8746f4806d49d04e6026.svg\" alt=\"\">Queens Thorn Longsword</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/lullaby-longbow\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/e193397621678e18dfc1.svg\" alt=\"\">Lullaby Longbow</a><br><span class=\"muted\">or</span> <a href=\"#/item/glamourweave-gloves-arms\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/478d7d6100a6e13c7c59.svg\" alt=\"\">Glamourweave Gloves Arms</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Captain Maren Holt says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-you\"><b>You:</b> Captain Holt wants to know what the Summer Queen is.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Ysolde Fairweather:</b> The last ruler of the old court. The court fell asleep long before Westergarde had a wall, and she slept with it.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Ysolde Fairweather:</b> The light in the moths and the moonharts woke her too. Her court is in the east Old Wood.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Ysolde Fairweather:</b> She carries a sigil. Bring that back and nobody can claim the court still has a queen.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Captain Maren Holt:</b> Her sigil. The court has no queen now, and the muster has nobody to march for.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Captain Maren Holt:</b> The court kept spoils. Take your pick of these.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"The court kept spoils. Take your pick of these.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>The Summer Court</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Captain Maren Holt says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-westergarde-the-summer-court\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}